  "metadata": {
    "title": "The traffic jam that moves backward",
    "description": "The cars move forward. The slow patch can move backward.\n\nIn a controlled experiment, 22 cars formed stop-and-go traffic on a circular track with no obstruction. Small speed changes can sometimes grow in dense traffic; not every jam starts this way.\n\nOriginal explanatory animation and experiment reconstruction. Synthetic narration.\nResearch: Sugiyama et al. (2008), https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/10/3/033001",
